; ---- being hit ------------------------------------------------------------
;
; Half a second apart at most for the heroes: three arrows landing at once should
; sound like trouble, not like a rattle.

; The knight and the mage: two of HaelDB's voices. The huntress has no CC0 voice
; to be found, so she is the blow landing and no more.
